{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446960/extras/shop06.png?t=1746151351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The story takes place in a modern city. After losing her job, a girl from the bottom of the ladder with bad luck, Chung Kwan, tries to find a cleaning job, but she mistakenly enters a cleaning company that is in the business of exorcising ghosts from murderous houses. When she tries to quit her job and is coerced by her boss, she has no choice but to catch ghosts. But as the story develops, the girl realizes that there is a reason for her constant bad luck. She awakens her divine power and sweeps away all the ghosts and demons, and even the boss has to take a beating if she doesn't obey ......</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446960/extras/shop02.png?t=1746151351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains a horror plot and graphics (it's not scary, it's kind of funny);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the game is a side-scrolling puzzle (with sufficient hints. My monkey said it's easy and has even written a guide and posted it in the community);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446960/extras/shop04.png?t=1746151351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game contains light battle scenes (you can save before the battle, and my capybara can handle it easily);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446960/extras/shop05.png?t=1746151351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That this game contains covered body and underwear nudity (there is but not much, no 18+, no one likes to see it).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https